{"id":2864,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年11月17日，软件学院第20251301期研究生华彩讲坛邀请到太原科技大学潘理虎教授作“智慧交通技术及应用”主题分享。讲座由科研科魏跃亲老师主持，全体研究生踊跃参加。</p><p> &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUzCxiM7C4UmUsMJml4oz94nlLZMm602M77ZUzlYL8CaU470gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4U1y4Mkh2L49aol7iLR9bLlC8MlLZM8lbMm-YnzWRMmnFMmrkL4LinNQFLlL8UN7Jv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PL4lagtA8pUacc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/13B34F3809A50891F45C87E9622E2C64/65B335FF/1C4BA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"393\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUzCxiM7C4UmUsMJml4oz94nlLZMm602M77ZUzlYL8CaU470gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4U1y4Mkh2L49aol7iLR9bLlC8MlLZM8lbMm-YnzWRMmnFMmrkL4LinNQFLlL8UN7Jv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PL4lagtA8pUacc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUmNxbLNUDMlQRoJ7-ZM8MVLNU4UNV02L8r2LRL8L8lYU8C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkL1hfokyPM4CZMNL8MlQRMRLPoR6VoR-sL4W7UNWRUlVFnlr7UmUPUzTFL4GYM1b/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz74MzGJqdanx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6B2A817686C45FC43187E82732DBBCAA/EEDB41A9/3026\" vheight=\"220\" vwidth=\"393\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUmNxbLNUDMlQRoJ7-ZM8MVLNU4UNV02L8r2LRL8L8lYU8C0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkL1hfokyPM4CZMNL8MlQRMRLPoR6VoR-sL4W7UNWRUlVFnlr7UmUPUzTFL4GYM1b/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz74MzGJqdanx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.jpg\"></p><p>潘理虎教授现从事领域软件工程理论与应用、复杂系统仿真、图像处理等方面的教学与科研工作。讲座中，潘教授结合自身科研工作开展情况，围绕当前智慧交通领域的技术需求，在总结交通信息化现状的基础上，探讨了智慧交通领域的主要科学问题和技术难题。从感知与通信、数据处理与分析、领域应用支撑等三个方面介绍了智慧交通领域的关键技术，并对智慧交通技术应用及发展趋势做了展望。</p><p>讲座尾声，潘理虎教授与学生围绕技术落地难点、学科方向交叉等内容展开深入交流，为大家提供了系统了解某一领域的实际案例，并为同学们发现各自领域难题与分析解决关键技术问题提供了思路。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUzvx8ozrko7WVUJzVRU8-io7-8U8U0iL49DUlUsMmCZoRC0gihFp2hmCIa0USysMYyPoSyDM774MznkLN7bMmNbU4TVn7lPMNQkUmLPLNWFoRnknRTfL7QFMzUPLN-Jqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PL4lagtA8pUacc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A771964A354B2A9699C9EDE16FBB312B/84BD9A0F/5412B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 432px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUNlxbUlrVLRNYMJ4lDUmrfMllDM7r0RUlV2n7U4MRNDL870gihFp2hmCIa0LYyDMYy8okyDnmARL7lanRr2nmWfoRv4L7UbUzUbUN-PLNQFMNlZn7lPMmWFMml4nN-YgtXaQ4Oeo4xY65AbgDTJQty0Lz78MYyPLzLiLkbw62a8c&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=OUzCxiM7C4UmUsMJml4oz94nlLZMm602M77ZUzlYL8CaU470gihFp2hmCIa0LSy4U1y4Mkh2L49aol7iLR9bLlC8MlLZM8lbMm-YnzWRMmnFMmrkL4LinNQFLlL8UN7Jv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PL4lagtA8pUacc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11350&e=.png"}